# P1, member c (k2, DW4_ONLINE_TEST_FORM=6: the form the others see moves on every 6 s, its own stays): stands in
# front of the entry point in a's view, then leaves through the lobby gate for a field, falls there (game over) and
# comes back to the lobby.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until epoch>=@92
goto 60 -45 3
idle until epoch>=@130
shot c_view
explore mate00 yes until stagechange,control
log in the field
die until dead
log dead
talk until stage=stagml11,control
log back in the lobby
idle until ghosts>=2 or frames>=900
log sees a and b
idle until frames>=30
shot c_back
idle until frames>=120
